meId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 170864516, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1258009478, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "KIRIM KE OPEN SOURCE (mike-workflows)", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "KIRIM KE OPEN SOURCE (mike-workflows)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "105d37dbb9494096a3cf", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 170, "width": 760, "height": 238.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["0a2c29605d5246b8b3d5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1908857937, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 834476132, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "166e04e05f384cbcb81d", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 192.1, "width": 429.9, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["0a2c29605d5246b8b3d5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 157033926, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 824861820, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Berbagi workflow PERSONAL  (workflow_shares)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Berbagi workflow PERSONAL  (workflow_shares)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "cb92d40fd3584da38864", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 223.9, "width": 346.4, "height": 162.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["0a2c29605d5246b8b3d5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1553247423, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1093430621, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "POST /workflows/:id/share {emails[], role}\n• hanya OWNER efektif yang boleh mengelola akses\n• role: owner | editor | viewer\n• target hanya akun yang SUDAH ada; email dinormalisasi\n   huruf kecil (constraint DB + unik per workflow,email)\n• upsert (workflow_id, shared_with_email):\n   berbagi ulang = ubah peran, tak menumpuk baris\nGET /:id/shares (daftar) · DELETE /:id/shares/:shareId\n   hasil delete DIBACA: id tak dikenal ≠ 204 palsu\n   (dulu klien menghapus baris padahal akses masih ada)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "POST /workflows/:id/share {emails[], role}\n• hanya OWNER efektif yang boleh mengelola akses\n• role: owner | editor | viewer\n• target hanya akun yang SUDAH ada; email dinormalisasi\n   huruf kecil (constraint DB + unik per workflow,email)\n• upsert (workflow_id, shared_with_email):\n   berbagi ulang = ubah peran, tak menumpuk baris\nGET /:id/shares (daftar) · DELETE /:id/shares/:shareId\n   hasil delete DIBACA: id tak dikenal ≠ 204 palsu\n   (dulu klien menghapus baris padahal akses masih ada)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "35665310c72b4913a150", "type": "rectangle", "x": 860, "y": 170, "width": 800, "height": 238.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["8d9901316e524ab181b6"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2139733916, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1619939580, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ecbd6aaf7adc43ba829c", "type": "text", "x": 874, "y": 184, "width": 578.5, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["8d9901316e524ab181b6"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2124405638, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 372767987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Berbagi workflow ORGANISASI  (workflow_org_access_overrides)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Berbagi workflow ORGANISASI  (workflow_org_access_overrides)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "cbf36dd3ede04a1abce3", "type": "text", "x": 874, "y": 215.8, "width": 322.4, "height": 178.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["8d9901316e524ab181b6"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 33481078, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 514825145, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "role: owner | editor | viewer | deny\ntarget harus ANGGOTA org saat ini; pembuat & peran\n   yang tak boleh di-override ditolak\nVALIDASI SEMUA target dulu, baru tulis APA PUN —\n   (dulu email ke-3 yang salah → 400 padahal 2\n   override pertama sudah tersimpan)\nsatu upsert massal: trigger keanggotaan menolak satu\n   baris → seluruh batch rollback\nvisibilitas: private (default) | organization (anggota\n   jadi Editor; tak keluar dari org)\npembuat selalu Owner; admin org default Owner", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "role: owner | editor | viewer | deny\ntarget harus ANGGOTA org saat ini; pembuat & peran\n   yang tak boleh di-override ditolak\nVALIDASI SEMUA target dulu, baru tulis APA PUN —\n   (dulu email ke-3 yang salah → 400 padahal 2\n   override pertama sudah tersimpan)\nsatu upsert massal: trigger keanggotaan menolak satu\n   baris → seluruh batch rollback\nvisibilitas: private (default) | organization (anggota\n   jadi Editor; tak keluar dari org)\npembuat selalu Owner; admin org default Owner", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "3535bd241fdb4220857a", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1700, "y": 170, "width": 680, "height": 238.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["33cf0cf1b8b2402aacda"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 116375075, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1391623730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "6e4ce48c8d1a4916b525", "type": "text", "x": 1714, "y": 232.8, "width": 255.2, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["33cf0cf1b8b2402aacda"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1171561943, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 156117281, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Daftar orang  GET /:id/people", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Daftar orang  GET /:id/people", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "044b621b352549e6a021", "type": "text", "x": 1714, "y": 264.5, "width": 338.8, "height": 81.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["33cf0cf1b8b2402aacda"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1420177970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1460859289, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Siapa pun yang bisa membuka workflow boleh membaca\n  roster akses.\norg: dari roster org (+ override), owner = pembuat\npersonal: dari tabel grant langsung\n  + foto profil yang di-scope", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Siapa pun yang bisa membuka workflow boleh membaca\n  roster akses.\norg: dari roster org (+ override), owner = pembuat\npersonal: dari tabel grant langsung\n  + foto profil yang di-scope", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "a56071698218465fb2e9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 420, "width": 2340, "height": 157.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["c6309d4690de44ad8ead"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 12788566, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1877638314, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "608f709361c549448f13", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 434, "width": 321.9, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["c6309d4690de44ad8ead"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 643945220, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1064049791, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Aset berkas (assistant workflow saja)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Aset berkas (assistant workflow saja)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "6554908221de47209aa4", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 465.8, "width": 636.9, "height": 97.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["c6309d4690de44ad8ead"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 220671342, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170920160, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Aset = baris documents biasa, ditandai workflow_id + library_kind 'workflow_asset'\nPOST /:id/assets/from-documents {document_ids[]}: SALIN versi aktif dokumen yang sudah bisa diakses —\n   setiap dokumen sumber dicek aksesnya SATU PER SATU (org_id & workflow_id ikut menentukan vonis);\n   daftar kosong/duplikat/melebihi batas → 400\nGET /:id/assets · DELETE /:id/assets/:assetId · workflow tabular: aset tidak didukung\nSaat dipakai chat: replicate_document dulu → salinan baru (aset sumber tak pernah diedit)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Aset = baris documents biasa, ditandai workflow_id + library_kind 'workflow_asset'\nPOST /:id/assets/from-documents {document_ids[]}: SALIN versi aktif dokumen yang sudah bisa diakses —\n   setiap dokumen sumber dicek aksesnya SATU PER SATU (org_id & workflow_id ikut menentukan vonis);\n   daftar kosong/duplikat/melebihi batas → 400\nGET /:id/assets · DELETE /:id/assets/:assetId · workflow tabular: aset tidak didukung\nSaat dipakai chat: replicate_document dulu → salinan baru (aset sumber tak pernah diedit)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "fc94516f2aa84fd2befe", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 650, "width": 520, "height": 172.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["d2459fa1626746f38758"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1912744813, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 724411974, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "1ae6c90c5c644b4a98d2", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a75750cdebc541fcac78", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 680.2, "width": 301.6, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["d2459fa1626746f38758"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 372549786, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 895468420, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 · POST /workflows/:id/open-source", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 · POST /workflows/:id/open-source", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "b0f97a8ab88c4f98aabb", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 710.8, "width": 296.2, "height": 81.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["d2459fa1626746f38758"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1762637771, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 387450584, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "hanya PEMBUAT (user_id = saya)\nvalidasi: assistant → prompt_md tak kosong;\n  tabular → ≥1 kolom; selain itu 400\ncontributor_mode: 'named' (nama profil/email)\n  atau 'anonymous' (default → kontributor generik)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "hanya PEMBUAT (user_id = saya)\nvalidasi: assistant → prompt_md tak kosong;\n  tabular → ≥1 kolom; selain itu 400\ncontributor_mode: 'named' (nama profil/email)\n  atau 'anonymous' (default → kontributor generik)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "6128f05d376544229520", "type": "rectangle", "x": 620, "y": 650, "width": 540, "height": 172.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["09ba9102f48a481c8a59"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 136879207, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 564853819, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "1ae6c90c5c644b4a98d2", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "9744a9eca515402297a9", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e431756090894fc184cb", "type": "text", "x": 634, "y": 672.1, "width": 179.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["09ba9102f48a481c8a59"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1242920586, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1034150148, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 · Snapshot & upsert", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 · Snapshot & upsert", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "126dc21044ce429e8759", "type": "text", "x": 634, "y": 702.6, "width": 297.5, "height": 97.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["09ba9102f48a481c8a59"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1615512166, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 285016717, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "buildOpenSourceSnapshot: salinan metadata + isi\n  workflow pada saat itu (jsonb snapshot)\nada submission 'pending' milik workflow+user?\n  → UPDATE di tempat (mode 'updated')\n  → bila tidak INSERT baru (mode 'created')\nunik: satu pending per (workflow, user)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "buildOpenSourceSnapshot: salinan metadata + isi\n  workflow pada saat itu (jsonb snapshot)\nada submission 'pending' milik workflow+user?\n  → UPDATE di tempat (mode 'updated')\n  → bila tidak INSERT baru (mode 'created')\nunik: satu pending per (workflow, user)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "48b53f71732e4d4799ec", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1200, "y": 650, "width": 560, "height": 172.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cf627807697943e98866"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2098693562, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1978460028, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "9744a9eca515402297a9", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "0a6b907d645043dca6b6", "type": "text", "x": 1214, "y": 664, "width": 79.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cf627807697943e98866"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 590842028, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2046105393, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177916, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 · Status", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 · Status", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "50bf733b91b545cbb831", "type": "text", "x": 1214, "y": 694.5, "width": 282.9, "height": 113.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "so